title: Reply-To Domain Mismatch
id: b25890bd-d6ca-418d-97e4-bc9cf33427f9
status: experimental
description: Detects emails whose Reply-To address points to a different, external domain than the From address, a technique used in BEC to redirect replies to an attacker-controlled mailbox.
author: Alaris Global
references:
  - https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1566/
logsource:
  category: mail
detection:
  selection:
    from_domain_internal: true
    replyto_domain_external: true
  condition: selection
fields:
  - sender
  - recipient
  - subject
falsepositives:
  - Legitimate use of external reply-to (marketing platforms)
level: medium
tags:
  - attack.initial_access
  - attack.t1566
